# Text files are stored and checked out with LF everywhere, whatever
# `core.autocrlf` is set to on the machine. Without this a checkout on Windows
# carries CRLF, and `npm run plugin-zip` then archives bytes that differ from the
# ZIP CI builds from the same commit.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Files a line-ending conversion would corrupt, declared so no future rule can
# reach them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
